    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8851" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Coela</span></b>  (ōrum, n.), Euboeae, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κοῖλα τῆς Εὐβοίας</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a deeply-indented maritime region in
